              },
              {
                "end": 554,
                "rank": 2,
                "text": "# Harbor R-17 display precision and measurement scope\nDocument status: final companion note for Night Restore R-17.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nThe dashboard prints whole-number success percentages. Its displayed success percentages for both Quill and Sable are 99 percent. The signed counts, not these rounded dashboard percentages, control the acceptance calculation.\nThe R-17 evidence package provides no maximum recovery time after a power failure for either candidate. Such a value cannot be inferred from ordinary nightly median restore latency.",
                "score": 6.5426185377,
                "start": 0,
