              {
                "end": 571,
                "rank": 3,
                "text": "# Harbor Night Restore R-17: signed result table\nDocument status: signed final; all attempted restores counted.\nSynthetic local data only. Both candidates used the same nightly archive workload and checksum verification rule.\nQuill: median restore latency 150 seconds; successful restores 198; attempted restores 200.\nSable: median restore latency 149 seconds; successful restores 395; attempted restores 400.\nThe accepted denominator includes every attempted restore; no failed attempt may be dropped. No power-failure restore-time measurement is included in this table.",
                "score": 5.9436427307,
                "start": 0,
                "title": "02-r17-signed-results.md",
